<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/undated">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · War</p><h1 class="enc-title">First World War</h1><p class="enc-meta">Also known as World War I, Great War</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The First World War (1914–1918) was a global conflict between the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/allies">Allied Powers</a>, including <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/britain">Britain</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/france">France</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/russia">Russia</a>, and the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/central-powers">Central Powers</a>, including <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/germany">Germany</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/austro-hungarian-empire">Austria-Hungary</a> and the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ottoman-empire">Ottoman Empire</a>. It destroyed the Austro-Hungarian, German, Russian and Ottoman Empires and severely weakened the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/british-empire">British Empire</a>. <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ali-dinar">Ali Dinar</a>'s alignment with the Ottomans during the war also led to the end of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/darfur-sultanate">Darfur Sultanate</a>.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/first-world-war.jpg" alt="First World War" width="320" height="239" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Collection DocAnciens/docpix.fr · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bataille_de_Verdun_1916.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
